Grammar

    0 $accept: Program $end

    1 Program: BlockBody

    2 Expressions: Expressions COMMA Expression
    3            | Expression

    4 NonAttributedExpression: Block
    5                        | Call
    6                        | Function
    7                        | Type
    8                        | MatchExpression
    9                        | RuntimeExpression
   10                        | WrappedExpressions
   11                        | Literal

   12 WrappedExpressions: LPAREN Expressions RPAREN

   13 Expression: Block
   14           | Call
   15           | Function
   16           | Type
   17           | MatchExpression
   18           | RuntimeExpression
   19           | WrappedExpressions
   20           | AttributedExpression
   21           | Literal

   22 Block: LBRACE BlockBody RBRACE

   23 BlockBody: Statements Expressions
   24          | Expressions

   25 MatchExpression: MATCH LPAREN Expression RPAREN LBRACE MatchCases RBRACE

   26 MatchCases: MatchCases MatchCase
   27           | MatchCase

   28 MatchCase: CASE Expression COLON Expressions SEMI

   29 Function: FUNCTION LPAREN FunctionParametersOptional RPAREN FunctionAttributesOptional FunctionBody PERCENT

   30 FunctionParametersOptional: FunctionParameters
   31                           | ε

   32 FunctionParameters: FunctionParameters COMMA FunctionParameter
   33                   | FunctionParameter

   34 FunctionParameter: AccessAttribute IDENTIFIER TypeAttribute

   35 FunctionAttributesOptional: FunctionAttributes
   36                           | ε

   37 FunctionAttributes: FunctionAttributes FunctionAttribute
   38                   | FunctionAttribute

   39 FunctionAttribute: FunctionExternalAttribute
   40                  | FunctionInternalAttribute

   41 FunctionExternalAttribute: EXTERNAL LPAREN Expressions RPAREN

   42 FunctionInternalAttribute: INTERNAL LPAREN Expressions RPAREN

   43 FunctionBody: COLON Expressions
   44             | ε

   45 Call: NonAttributedExpression LPAREN Expressions RPAREN

   46 RuntimeExpression: RUNTIME LPAREN Expression RPAREN

   47 Literal: STRING
   48        | INTEGER
   49        | FLOAT
   50        | CHAR
   51        | Identifier
   52        | MACRO
   53        | NIL

   54 Identifier: Identifier DOT IDENTIFIER
   55           | IDENTIFIER

   56 Type: TYPE LPAREN Expression RPAREN LBRACE TypeEntries RBRACE

   57 Statements: Statements Statement
   58           | Statement

   59 Statement: CallStatement
   60          | AssignmentStatement
   61          | ContinueStatement
   62          | BreakStatement
   63          | LabelStatement

   64 CallStatement: Call SEMI

   65 AssignmentStatement: AssignmentTarget EQ Expressions SEMI

   66 AssignmentTarget: AccessAttribute IDENTIFIER TypeAttribute
   67                 | Identifier
   68                 | UNDERSCORE

   69 ContinueStatement: CONTINUE IDENTIFIER Expressions SEMI

   70 BreakStatement: BREAK IDENTIFIER Expressions SEMI

   71 LabelStatement: IDENTIFIER COLON MatchExpression SEMI
   72               | IDENTIFIER COLON SEMI

   73 TypeAttributeOptional: TypeAttribute
   74                      | ε

   75 TypeAttribute: COLON Expression

   76 TypeEntries: TypeEntries TypeEntry
   77            | TypeEntry

   78 TypeEntry: IDENTIFIER TypeAttributeOptional SEMI

   79 AccessAttribute: IN
   80                | OUT
   81                | INOUT

   82 PointerAttribute: PTR
   83                 | REF

   84 AttributedExpression: AccessAttribute Expression
   85                     | PointerAttribute AttributedExpression


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    error (256)
    COMMA (258) 2 32
    LBRACE (259) 22 25 56
    RBRACE (260) 22 25 56
    LPAREN (261) 12 25 29 41 42 45 46 56
    RPAREN (262) 12 25 29 41 42 45 46 56
    SEMI (263) 28 64 65 69 70 71 72 78
    COLON (264) 28 43 71 72 75
    EQ (265) 65
    UNDERSCORE (266) 68
    PERCENT (267) 29
    DOT (268) 54
    MATCH (269) 25
    CASE (270) 28
    FUNCTION (271) 29
    TYPE (272) 56
    EXTERNAL (273) 41
    INTERNAL (274) 42
    IN (275) 79
    OUT (276) 80
    INOUT (277) 81
    REF (278) 83
    PTR (279) 82
    CONTINUE (280) 69
    BREAK (281) 70
    RUNTIME (282) 46
    IDENTIFIER (283) 34 54 55 66 69 70 71 72 78
    STRING (284) 47
    INTEGER (285) 48
    FLOAT (286) 49
    CHAR (287) 50
    MACRO (288) 52
    NIL (289) 53


